<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαίδ-ευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uneducated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδεύσωμεν τὸν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					493
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				175d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιθανώτεροι οἱ ἀ. τῶν πεπαιδευμένων ἐν
					τοῖς ὄχλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1395b27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				989
			</span></i>: c. gen. rei, <i>uninstructed in . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>boorish, rude,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				510b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆμα ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					269b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					284
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					213.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μαρτυρία</span>
			<i>clumsy</i> evidence, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.70
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζητήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Ti.</u>
					2.23
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nicoch.
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					559d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					247
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				267.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				6.36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φληναφᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.227S.
				</span></i>
			</div>
